@startuml activity_document_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7E6

title Activity: Document Pipeline\n(Upload -> Parse -> Chunk -> Vector Index)

|Instructor / Browser|
start
:Choose PDF / DOCX / PPTX;

|web-bff|
:Request upload session;

|core-api|
:Validate metadata\n(course_id, mime type, size);
if (File type valid?) then (No)
  :Reject upload request;
  |web-bff|
  :Show upload error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|Stores & Events|
:Create document record\nstatus = UPLOADING;
:Create presigned MinIO URL;

|web-bff|
:Return upload_url to browser;

|Instructor / Browser|
:PUT file directly to MinIO;

|web-bff|
:Confirm upload;

|core-api|
:Mark document QUEUED;

|Stores & Events|
:Publish DocumentUploaded;

|document-worker|
:Consume DocumentUploaded;
:Download raw file from MinIO;
:Set status = PARSING;
:Parse file by type;
if (Text layer good enough?) then (No)
  :Run OCR fallback;
else (Yes)
  :Use extracted text layer;
endif

:Normalize text;
:Extract heading structure\nand metadata;
if (Reliable headings?) then (Yes)
  :Chunk by heading path;
else (No)
  :Fallback size-based chunking;
endif

:Map chunks to LO\nif heading / context matches;

|Stores & Events|
:Persist chunks in PostgreSQL\n+ outbox events (single transaction);

|document-worker|
:Embed chunks with BGE-M3;

|Stores & Events|
:Upsert vectors to Qdrant\npayload = course / document / chunk / LO;
:Set document status = INDEXED;
:Publish TextIndexed;

note right
  TextIndexed is the readiness event
  for Micro-Content and Quiz pipelines.
end note

|web-bff|
:Stream progress via SSE;

|Instructor / Browser|
:Show INDEXED status;
stop
@enduml
